AMD HSA runtime set (libhsa-runtime64.so.1, libhsa-amd-aqlprofile64.so.1,
librocprofiler-register.so.0 and the rocm_sysdeps libraries, packed beside the HRX llama.cpp libraries in
hrx/llama/bin)

HRX reaches the GPU through this set. The engine's backend opens the runtime BY NAME at run time
(ggml-hrx-dmabuf.cpp:29, dlopen("libhsa-runtime64.so.1")), and the runtime in turn opens the aqlprofile
agent by name, so ldd never sees either: the whole set ships in the payload, beside the backend, and the
payload's RUNPATH is $ORIGIN - nothing resolves out of the install (engine #1411). Shipped unmodified, as
built by TheRock; the release refuses a payload that carries the set incompletely.

- libhsa-runtime64.so.1 (ROCr). Upstream https://github.com/ROCm/rocr-runtime, built by TheRock
  (https://github.com/ROCm/TheRock). Copyright (c) 2014-2025 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
  University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License (NCSA).

- libhsa-amd-aqlprofile64.so.1, the profiling agent the runtime opens by name. Upstream
  https://github.com/ROCm/aqlprofile. Copyright (c) Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. MIT License.

- librocprofiler-register.so.0, the profiling registration shim. Upstream
  https://github.com/ROCm/rocprofiler-register. Copyright (c) Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. MIT License.

- librocm_sysdeps_*.so* - TheRock's rocm_sysdeps build of the system libraries the runtime links, so the
  payload does not depend on which version a distribution ships. Each is unmodified from TheRock and keeps
  its upstream licence:

    librocm_sysdeps_bz2.so          libbzip2   https://sourceware.org/bzip2/                bzip2-1.0.6
    librocm_sysdeps_drm.so.2        libdrm     https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/drm     MIT
    librocm_sysdeps_drm_amdgpu.so.1 libdrm     https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/drm     MIT
    librocm_sysdeps_elf.so.1        libelf     https://sourceware.org/elfutils/            GPL-3.0-or-later OR LGPL-3.0-or-later
    librocm_sysdeps_liblzma.so.5    liblzma    https://tukaani.org/xz/                     public domain (0BSD)
    librocm_sysdeps_numa.so.1       libnuma    https://github.com/numactl/numactl          LGPL-2.1
    librocm_sysdeps_z.so.1          zlib       https://zlib.net/                           Zlib
    librocm_sysdeps_zstd.so.1       zstd       https://github.com/facebook/zstd            BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0

